Description: Prevent event waiters from blocking event delivery
 Record pending notifications instead of holding the waiter mutex
 between setup and wait. Consume an early notification when waiting
 and coalesce multiple pending notifications.
 .
 Add event waiter tests and an avformat startup regression test for
 pre-armed fatal-error and stopped waiters.
 .
 Carried without the commit's additions to
 src/tests/test_events/test_events.cpp and
 src/tests/test_mod_avformat/test_mod_avformat.cpp, which need the test files
 of the later tree; the change to the library is upstream's, unchanged.
Origin: backport, https://github.com/mltframework/mlt/commit/be583ee302a26ea24d0a5ddb1ec01c5191063ec3
Author: Brian Matherly
Bug: https://github.com/mltframework/mlt/issues/1333
Applied-Upstream: master after v7.42.0, https://github.com/mltframework/mlt/pull/1366 (merged 2026-11-22 as be583ee302a26ea24d0a5ddb1ec01c5191063ec3)
